            <ArticleTitle>Lifting and handling. Strategies for altering practice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The elderly services directorate at the Ipswich Hospital NHS Trust has already embarked on changing nurses' patient-handling practice in response to EC regulations. This paper describes how problems hindered the programme's initial success and explores how new strategies have been implemented to overcome them.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
